{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Janitor Phase 1 Discovery completed on fixed snapshot `9a94ef9737fbdf070ae314bba6e797319aee2301`; final worktree status remained clean and no product/test/config/docs files changed.\n\nCoverage completed for all 12 required concerns, including four comment shards, three test-suite-health shards, three oracle-strength shards, and a repository-wide temporal-decay pass. The pool contains 113 raw, unscored finding objects. Consolidation merged recurring clusters (notably the dormant typed summary executor, discarded reviewer selection, inert `BLOCKING_SEVERITIES`, unconsumed provider tier, runner recurrence, close/reconciler growth, and MCP-health pressure) while retaining corroborating citations and negative evidence.\n\nPhase 2 is now running with fresh independent blue-team verifiers. They are checking cited-reference accuracy, entailment, reachable harm, prior decisions/history, and the current known-fine registry before the fixed validity/impact floors are applied. No remediation or ticket creation has begun."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788043232866997169,"uuid":"a718326f-77b8-40c2-881d-0cd761885659"}